WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.470
I took the first close-up pictures of another planet.

2
00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:13.850
My pictures came home so slowly that people didn't want to wait for the computers.

3
00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:21.420
They printed my numbers on strips of paper and coloured them in by hand, like a paint-by-numbers.

4
00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:29.120
Mars turned out to be cratered and dry. No canals. No cities.

5
00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:33.880
I sent you 21 pictures of a cratered world.
